# Integration test suites (tests/<name>.rs) that need services the in-process
# suites do not: a readur server on API_URL (default http://localhost:8000) with
# its database, or the Dufs WebDAV server on WEBDAV_SERVER_URL.
#
# CI runs these in the "Live-server suites" job, which starts those services, and
# every other suite in the sharded in-process jobs
# (.github/workflows/test-integration.yml). scripts/ci/live-server-filterset.sh
# turns this list into the nextest filterset both use, so a suite is in exactly
# one of them. Many of these skip, rather than fail, when the server is down, so
# a missing entry would let them pass without testing anything;
# tests/integration_tooling_env_tests.rs checks this list against the suites
# that talk to a live server.
#
# One test binary name per line; blank lines and # comments are ignored.
